      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly multi-channel analysis
Frequency: Monthly; 4 channels
Volume: 4 channels/month
Owner: Digital Marketing Manager
Participants: Digital Marketing Mgr, VP Marketing
Source: workflow W2255 — Channel-Specific Promotion Effectiveness</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2255_LaneSet2">
