      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Quarterly segment analysis
Frequency: Quarterly; 6 segments
Volume: ~6 segments/quarter
Owner: CRM Manager
Participants: VP Marketing
Source: workflow W2256 — Customer Segment Promotion Response</bpmn:documentation>
