      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2256_Task4" name="CRM Manager analyzes promotion response by customer segment: loyalty tier…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CRM Manager analyzes promotion response by customer segment: loyalty tier (Bronze/Silver/Gold/Platinum), demographic, purchase-history; identifies high-responsive segments for targeted future campaigns
Responsible (R): CRM Manager
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: 2–3 days/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2256_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2256_Flow9</bpmn:outgoing>
