      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly tech review
Frequency: Monthly; 4 platforms
Volume: 4 platforms
Owner: IT Integration Lead
Participants: CIO
Source: workflow W2259 — Digital Coupon Technology Performance</bpmn:documentation>
