      <bpmn:userTask id="W2261_Task4" name="VP Marketing optimizes the promotion calendar: event timing (align with…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: VP Marketing optimizes the promotion calendar: event timing (align with seasonal calendar, avoid promo-fatigue clusters), event depth (calibrate to the ROI history), event mix (coupon vs. loyalty-multiplier vs. markdown); balances promo frequency against full-price sales
Responsible (R): VP Marketing
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: 3–5 days</bpmn:documentation>
